{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0JsYWNrbWFpbCUyMCUyODIwMDUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Blackmail","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tIho6RIwbKOCAOQARqnpLGEwIb6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zBv0SKNADxGpIj7j0ayQ3FWfFsG.jpg","description":"Inspector Abhay Rathod is a honest and diligent Police Inspector employed with Bombay Police. He was assigned the case of racketeer and criminal don, Shekhar Mohan. Abhay successfully entraps and arrests him, and has him sentenced to a long jail term. Years later, Abhay is now the Assistant Commissioner of Police; is married, and has a son named Chirag; and Shekhar Mohan has completed his jail term and is looking to seek vengeance against Abhay. He does so by kidnapping Chirag and taking him along with him. He object is not to seek any ransom money, but attempt to separate the child from his parents, as well as attempt to make a place in his heart. Shekhar finds out that Chirag loves racing and takes him on various race courses where the child is thrilled to watch fast sport cars, and soon starts a friendship with \"Uncle\" Shekhar. But with Abhay and the police closing in fast, will Shekhar and Chirag be able to maintain their friendship?\n\nRated U · Released 28 Jan 2005 · India · Language: Hindi · 126 min\nStudio: Siddhi Vinayak Creations, Devgan Entertainment Software\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["Thriller","Action","Drama","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.1","runtime":"126 min","cast":["Ajay Devgn","Suniel Shetty","Priyanka Chopra Jonas","Dia Mirza","Mukesh Rishi","Parth Dave","Siddharth Ray","Shiva Rindani"],"director":["Anil Devgan"],"released":"2005-01-28T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"It's not always good to know a secret!","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anil Devgan","character":"Director"},{"name":"Ajay Devgn","character":"Shekhar Mohan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vnHQQFzTjJ